ts and large $E_{\text{T}}^{\text{miss}}$ and $p_{\textrm{T}}^{\\ell\\ell}$ ."], "reasoning": "", "answer_text": "", "section": "3 $\\ell$ selection", "window": 3, "escalated": false, "raw": "```json\n{\"reasoning\": \"The text mentions that SR ${}^{Z}_{2{\\textrm{A}}}$ features no requirement on the number of $b$ -tagged jets, but SR ${}^{Z}_{2{\\textrm{B}}}$ requires the presence of $b$ -tagged jets.\", \"quote\": \"SR ${}^{Z}_{2{\\textrm{B}}}$ also includes an upper bound on the third leading lepton $p_{\\text{T}}$ but requires the presence of $b$ -tagged jets and large $E_{\\text{T}}^{\\text{miss}}$ and $p_{\\textrm{T}}^{\\ell\\ell}$ .\", \"answer\": \"yes\"}\n```"}]}, "Does the event selection require missing transverse momentum (MET / ETmiss / pTmiss)?": {"answer": false, "quote": "", "unanimous": true, "verdicts": [{"paper_id": "2006.05880", "qid": "gf-01.c2", "answer": false, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "quotes": [], "reasoning": "", "answer_text": "", "section": " + Introduction", "window": 0, "escalated": false, "raw": "```json\n{\"reasoning\": \"The text describes the search for top squarks in events with a Higgs or Z boson, but it does not mention missing transverse momentum (MET / ETmiss / pTmiss) as a requirement for event selection.\", \"quote\": \"\", \"answer\": \"no\"}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2006.05880", "qid": "gf-01.c2", "answer": false, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "quotes": [], "reasoning": "", "answer_text": "", "section": " + Introduction", "window": 0, "escalated": false, "raw": "```json\n{\"reasoning\": \"The text discusses the search for top squarks in events with a Higgs or Z boson, but it does not mention missing transverse momentum (MET / ETmiss / pTmiss) as a requirement for event selection.\", \"quote\": \"\", \"answer\": \"no\"}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2006.05880", "qid": "gf-01.c2", "answer": false, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "quotes": [], "reasoning": "", "answer_text": "", "section": "ATLAS detector + Da