 "", "quote_verified": false, "quotes": [], "reasoning": "", "answer_text": "", "section": "Event simulation and cross section calculation + Measurements of quantum chromodynamics", "window": 5, "escalated": false, "raw": "```json\n{\"reasoning\": \"The text describes the measurement of cross sections and their comparison with the predictions of the Standard Model (SM). It also mentions measurements of quantum chromodynamics (QCD) and various related quantities, but does not explicitly state that the analysis is a search for new physics.\", \"quote\": \"\", \"answer\": \"no\"}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2405.18661", "qid": "gf-01.c0", "answer": false, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "quotes": [], "reasoning": "", "answer_text": "", "section": "Event simulation and cross section calculation + Measurements of quantum chromodynamics", "window": 5, "escalated": false, "raw": "```json\n{\"reasoning\": \"The text describes the measurement of cross sections and their comparison with the predictions of the SM, and it details various measurements essential for probing QCD in nonperturbative and perturbative regimes. It does not explicitly state that the analysis is a search for new physics.\", \"quote\": \"\", \"answer\": \"no\"}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2405.18661", "qid": "gf-01.c0", "answer": false, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "quotes": [], "reasoning": "", "answer_text": "", "section": "Total inelastic cross sections + Jet production cross section measurements + Inclusive fiducial jet production cross section measurements", "window": 6, "escalated": false, "raw": "```json\n{\"reasoning\": \"The text describes measurements of total inelastic cross sections and jet production cross sections, comparing them with Standard Model predictions and other measurements, but does not mention searching for new physics.\", \"quote\": \"\", \"answer\": \"no\"}\n```"}, {"paper_id": "2405.18661", "qid": "gf-01.c0", "answer": false, "quote": "", "quote_verified": false, "quotes": 